"sent_id": "t0016.s03"
},
{
"start": 175.338,
"end": 176.513,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 2973,
"char_end": 2993,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s01"
},
{
"start": 176.513,
"end": 184.272,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Most of the mysterious creaking noises are resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and re-tightening them to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 2994,
"char_end": 3126,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s02"
},
{
"start": 184.272,
"end": 188.21,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "We've seen this happen with equipment that uses Shimano components.",
"char_start": 3127,
"char_end": 3194,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s03"
},
{
"start": 188.21,
"end": 192.559,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating in three different sets of equipment.",
"char_start": 3195,
"char_end": 3269,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s04"
},
{
"start": 192.559,
"end": 193.721,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Tell me a specific example.",
"char_start": 3285,
"char_end": 3312,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s01"
},
{
"start": 193.721,
"end": 197.252,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What is something you used to believe about this that you have since re-evaluated?",
"char_start": 3313,
"char_end": 3395,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s02"
},
{
"start": 197.252,
"end": 205.49,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Yes, see – a bike should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention can stay focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 3410,
