"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s01"
},
{
"start": 205.49,
"end": 210.668,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3516,
"char_end": 3582,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s02"
},
{
"start": 210.668,
"end": 211.443,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 3598,
"char_end": 3616,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s01"
},
{
"start": 211.443,
"end": 214.843,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What's something you used to believe about this that you've since re-evaluated?",
"char_start": 3617,
"char_end": 3696,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s02"
},
{
"start": 214.843,
"end": 216.215,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 3711,
"char_end": 3731,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s01"
},
{
"start": 216.215,
"end": 223.279,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "The wear and tear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 3732,
"char_end": 3835,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s02"
},
{
"start": 223.279,
"end": 227.257,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "We've seen this in equipment that uses Shimano components.",
"char_start": 3836,
"char_end": 3894,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s03"
},
{
"start": 227.257,
"end": 231.783,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3895,
"char_end": 3961,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s04"
},
{
"start": 231.783,
"end": 232.532,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "That makes sense.",
"char_start": 3977,
"char_end": 3994,
"unit_id": "t0022.u01",
"sent_id": "t0022.s01"
},
{
"start": 232.532,
"end": 244.133,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within that workflow, the value becomes apparent. If you ignore that, you'll end up rebuilding it from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 4009,
"char_end": 4169,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s01"
},
{
"start": 244.133,
"end": 245.352,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 4185,
"char_end": 4207,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s01"
},
{
"start": 245.352,
"end": 249.341,
"speaker_label": "Lucía Herrera",
"text": "What is the operational aspect that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 4208,
"char_end": 4280,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s02"
},
{
"start": 249.341,
"end": 250.766,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 4295,
"char_end": 4315,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s01"
},
{
"start": 250.766,
"end": 255.898,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "The service intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 4316,
"char_end": 4388,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s02"
},
{
"start": 255.898,
"end": 260.317,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 4389,
"char_end": 4451,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s03"
},
{
"start": 260.317,
"end": 264.29,
